Helix design tokens
===================

The token values in this folder derive from two MIT-licensed sources.

1. Aura preset of PrimeUIX / PrimeNG (PrimeTek Informatics)
   Most of `src/semantic.ts`, `src/components/*` and the neutral scales and radii of `src/primitive.ts` started
   as the Aura theme preset and were adapted for Helix (surface scale, text colours, fonts, radii, component
   details). https://github.com/primefaces/primeuix  (MIT)

2. Tailwind CSS colour palettes (Tailwind Labs, Inc.)
   `src/tailwind.ts` holds Tailwind's colour scales; `src/palettes.ts` is a derivative with reduced chroma.
   https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss  (MIT)

